Books API ΓÇö Lab08 Starter

Γûí books
Γöö GET /books ΓÇö initial list
  GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/books [200 OK, 167B, 24ms]
  ΓêÜ  List returns 200 OK
  ΓêÜ  List is an array of book objects

Γöö POST /books ΓÇö create
  POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/books [201 CREATED, 259B, 17ms]
  ΓêÜ  Create returns 201 Created
  ΓêÜ  Created book has a positive integer id and saves book_id
  ΓêÜ  Created book matches the submitted values
  ΓêÜ  Create supplies the resource Location

Γöö GET /books/{id} ΓÇö read
  GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/books/1 [200 OK, 234B, 5ms]
  ΓêÜ  Read returns 200 OK
  ΓêÜ  Read returns the created book and its values

Γöö PUT /books/{id} ΓÇö replace
  PUT http://127.0.0.1:5000/books/1 [200 OK, 242B, 15ms]
  ΓêÜ  Replace returns 200 OK
  ΓêÜ  Replace keeps the id and returns the updated values

Γöö DELETE /books/{id} ΓÇö delete
  DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5000/books/1 [204 NO CONTENT, 161B, 13ms]
  ΓêÜ  Delete returns 204 No Content
  ΓêÜ  Delete returns an empty response body

Γûí error-cases
Γöö POST /books - missing title
  POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/books [400 BAD REQUEST, 307B, 5ms]
  ΓêÜ  Missing title returns 400 Bad Request
  ΓêÜ  Missing title returns the validation error contract
  ΓêÜ  Validation details identify the missing title

Γöö GET /books/9999 - not found
  GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/books/9999 [404 NOT FOUND, 220B, 5ms]
  ΓêÜ  Missing book returns 404 Not Found
  ΓêÜ  Missing book returns NOT_FOUND and its message

